CHAPTER.VERS:
Far be it from me that I should justify you

          {+}
        : Until I die I will not put away my integrity from me.

I will teach you

          {+}
         concerning the hand of God; That which is with the Almighty I will not conceal.

Look, all you

          {+}
         yourselves have seen it; Why then have you

          {+}
         become altogether vain?
